cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "splatweb: a from-scratch 3D Gaussian Splatting renderer for WebGPU"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "the splatweb authors"
abstract: "A hand-written 3D Gaussian Splatting renderer for WebGPU in TypeScript and WGSL: streaming .ply/.splat loaders, compute preprocessing with EWA projection and spherical harmonics, a GPU radix sort, and premultiplied-alpha splat rasterization."
repository-code: "https://github.com/coopersimpson101-debug/splatweb"
url: "https://coopersimpson101-debug.github.io/splatweb/"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - gaussian splatting
  - webgpu
  - wgsl
  - rendering
  - radix sort
